
  Ultimate Linux live.  Arch-based, with Claude built in.

  Meta+Space           ask Claude from the top bar; its work shows on the desktop
  ask <question>       ask Claude about this machine (read-only tools)
  ask --login          sign in with your Claude subscription
  claude               Claude Code, with the system tools already wired in
  sudo archinstall --config /etc/ultimate/archinstall.json
                       install to disk, with the networking tools preselected

